          "quote": "After ball milling, the mixed powders were loaded into a 40 mm diameter graphite mold and sintered utilizing an SPS ma- chine (HPD25, FCT Systeme). The SPS sintering was performed at 1200 °C for 10 min under a vacuum with an applied pressure of 35 MPa. Following the sintering stage, the average cooling rate from the sintering temperature to RT was approximately 120 °C min−1 .",
